# Project Workflow

- This project uses direct pushes to `main`; do not require feature branches for routine changes.
- This project does not use JIRA ticket IDs for commit messages unless the user explicitly provides one.
- Pushing to `main` is expected to trigger the configured Vercel deployment automatically.
- There are no separate deployment environments for normal workflow; treat `main` as the deployable branch.
